`github.com/joshua-kea/tek-eksamen` → Actions

## Kør manuelt
Actions → `maven.yml` → Run workflow

## Workflow-filer
`github.com/joshua-kea/tek-eksamen/blob/main/.github/workflows/ci.yml`
`github.com/joshua-kea/tek-eksamen/blob/main/.github/workflows/maven.yml`

## Hash-pinning
```yaml
uses: actions/checkout@11bd71901bbe5b1630ceea73d27597364c9af683
```

## Caching
```yaml
- name: Cache Maven packages
  uses: actions/cache@v4
  with:
    path: ~/.m2
    key: ${{ runner.os }}-maven-${{ hashFiles('**/pom.xml') }}
    restore-keys: |
      ${{ runner.os }}-maven-
```
